@module level6data ; Level 6
@about The level's body: the header the game reads at $C4AE, the sprites, the object table, the metatiles, the map, the wave script, the enemy kinds and their movement scripts, the two mover tables and the movers.
$C4AE b L6Header ; The level header: restart point, checkpoints and the pointers the game reads
> Restart column $00, restart wave $DADD; checkpoint columns $00, $27, $FF with wave entries $DADD, $DBFA, $DD26; objects $CC33, map $D9A7, kinds $E362, movers $E612 and $E620.
$C4AF L6RestartWave ; the wave entry a life restarts at (the game keeps its live copy here)
