$C4BA L6Pointers ; objects, map, kinds, movers 1, movers 2
$C4C4 b L6Spare ; zeros up to the sprites
$C4E0 b L6Sprites 9 ; The level's sprites: cells of 9 bytes (attribute, 8 pixel bytes) the object table points at
