$CC33 b L6Objects 4 ; The level's object table: width, height, the cells' address (LevelObject)
@res levels/level6/objects.bin
$CCB7 b L6Metatiles 9 ; The metatiles, 144 bytes each (4 x 4 cells of 9 bytes), numbered down from the map: metatile n at $D9A7 - 144 x (n + 1) (MetatileAddress); 23 of them
@res levels/level6/metatiles.bin
$D9A7 b L6Map 5 ; The map: 5 bytes a block column (62 columns), each byte a metatile (bits 0-5) and its drawer (bits 6-7)
